{
  "title": "Overwork",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "What it is",
      "lines": [
        "20 FX machines on",
        "the live input, with",
        "a step sequencer",
        "that parameter-locks",
        "them.",
        "Two insert slots in",
        "series, two FX LFOs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The main gesture",
      "lines": [
        "HOLD a step button",
        "and TURN a knob.",
        "That parameter is",
        "now locked on that",
        "step.",
        "Hold+Shift+knob",
        "edits the base",
        "value instead."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step buttons",
      "lines": [
        "Tap: trig on/off",
        "Hold+knob: lock",
        "Hold+jog: set the",
        "attribute the mode",
        "pad selected",
        "Hold+pad row3 r:",
        "clear that step's",
        "locks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step LEDs",
      "lines": [
        "Dim: in length,",
        "no trig",
        "White: plain trig",
        "Green: has locks",
        "Cyan: conditional",
        "Red: playhead",
        "Bright green: held"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads rows 1-3",
      "lines": [
        "Machine palette.",
        "Tap to load one",
        "into the focused",
        "slot. The loaded",
        "machine is white.",
        "Last four of row 3:",
        "COND, MICRO, RTRG,",
        "and lock clear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pad row 4",
      "lines": [
        "Play/Stop, Fill,",
        "Slot focus,",
        "Pattern page,",
        "Edit page,",
        "Copy, Paste,",
        "Clear.",
        "Clear: tap = page,",
        "hold = whole thing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs and jog",
      "lines": [
        "Knobs 1-8 are the",
        "edit page's eight",
        "parameters.",
        "Jog sets pattern",
        "length, or the held",
        "step's attribute.",
        "Jog click cycles",
        "the edit page."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Trig conditions",
      "lines": [
        "FILL and !FIL react",
        "to the Fill pad.",
        "PRE and !PRE follow",
        "the last condition.",
        "1ST fires only on",
        "the first pass.",
        "A:B fires on pass A",
        "of every B."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Lock behaviour",
      "lines": [
        "Each firing trig is",
        "a full snapshot:",
        "locked params take",
        "their value, others",
        "go back to base.",
        "A trig that does",
        "not fire changes",
        "nothing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Notes",
      "lines": [
        "Retrig restarts the",
        "LFOs and the filter",
        "envelope, it does",
        "not stutter audio.",
        "Use Degrader FREZ",
        "for that.",
        "Start/continue",
        "restarts the pattern."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
